  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UniPod Project  Botswana 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Botswana CO is to establish a University Innovation Pod, a unique initiative to be located at a national public university - University of Botswana, with the objective of fostering innovation, entrepreneurship, and creativity to support youth, private sector and industry. The UNIPOD will be a collaborative and interdisciplinary space where students, faculty, researchers, and industry partners come together to explore, develop, and implement innovative ideas, projects, and solutions. The UNIPODs would function in a way to activate and align faculty knowledge generation with downstream commercialization, in collaborative ventures between faculty, students and youth.</narrative>
  </description>
